&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 48px; line-height: 15px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size: 10px"&gt;　　　株式会社SCREEN IP ソリューションズ&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 78px; line-height: 15px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -30px"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="style_pb_after" style="margin-left: 78px; line-height: 15px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -30px"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
